  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 200°C."
    },
    {
      "text": "Cut the cauliflower into small florets, slice the carrots and red onion into strips and drain the chickpeas. Line a baking tray with baking paper and arrange the vegetables and chickpeas on it. Drizzle with olive oil and add the spices. Roast for about 50 minutes, until golden and tender."
    },
    {
      "text": "Make the sauce: mix the sauce ingredients well until fairly runny. A stick blender helps."
    },
    {
      "text": "Transfer the vegetables to a bowl, pour over the sauce and serve with crumbled feta, parsley and almonds."
    }
  ]
